  "bio": "Ren Sutcliffe is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Cork, Ireland, who specializes in sketch, fineline, and floral designs. With a keen eye for detail and mastery over these styles, Ren ensures that each piece of art is intricately crafted to meet the unique visions of their clients. Their professionalism and dedication to the craft are evident in the stunning tattoos they create at Propaganda Tattoo & Piercing.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cork, Ireland"
}
